COMPILATION OF: E52XD

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52XD

   1 a 0000 E52XD: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-11 probe XD (PLAN H-D): LOAN2:56 mirror
   3 a 0006       -- VARIABLE varying title + print (?SLVTS route,
   4 a 0006       E52TC block, w1 0E52) then a bare file PAGE. */
   5 c 0006    dcl pf file;
   6 c 0006    dcl name char(14) varying;
   7 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
   8 c 0006    open file(pf) title(name) print;
   9 c 0021    put file(pf) page;
  10 c 0033    x = 2;
  11 a 0039 end E52XD;

CODE SIZE = 003C
DATA AREA = 0011
FREE SYMS = 38B7
END  COMPILATION
